{'symbol': 'CTAS', 'date': '2023-04-18 06:00:00', 'title': 'REDAPTIVE PARTNERS WITH CINTAS TO REDUCE ENERGY CONSUMPTION AT CINTAS FACILITIES', 'text': 'DENVER--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ENERGY-AS-A-SERVICE LEADER REDAPTIVE TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS WORKING WITH CINTAS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CTAS) ON A MULTI-YEAR PROJECT TO HELP CINTAS REDUCE ENERGY CONSUMPTION COMPANY-WIDE AS PART OF ITS INITIATIVE TO ACHIEVE NET ZERO GHG EMISSIONS BY 2050. CINTAS PROVIDES UNIFORMS AND APPAREL IN ADDITION TO INDUSTRIAL LAUNDRY AND CLEANING SERVICES TO MORE THAN ONE MILLION BUSINESSES OF ALL KINDS THROUGHOUT NORTH AMERICA.'}